#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Overview of the available plans, including Pay-As-You-Go, Premium, and Open"
msgstr ""
"Pangkalahatang-tanaw ng mga available na plano, kasama ang Pay-As-You-Go, "
"Premium, at Open"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plans overview"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-tanaw ng mga plano"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud-plans\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud-plans\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Plans overview {#plans-overview}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-tanaw ng mga plano {#plans-overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum Platform has Open (free access) and paid plans, as described "
"below. See [IBM Quantum access plans](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/pricing) "
"for full details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang IBM Quantum Platform ay may Open (libreng access) at mga bayad na plano,"
" tulad ng nakalarawan sa ibaba. Tingnan ang [IBM Quantum access "
"plans](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/pricing) para sa kumpletong detalye.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you want access to multiple plans, you can create multiple instances and "
"assign different plans to them.  For example, you can have an Open Plan "
"instance and a Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance.  You can set preferred instances"
" to use in the `QiskitRuntimeService` initializer or "
"`QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()` method.  Example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung gusto mong ma-access ang maraming plano, puwede kang gumawa ng maraming"
" instance at mag-assign ng iba't ibang plano sa mga ito. Halimbawa, puwede "
"kang magkaroon ng Open Plan instance at isang Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance. "
"Puwede mong itakda ang mga preferred na instance sa `QiskitRuntimeService` "
"initializer o sa `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()` na paraan. "
"Halimbawa:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Open Plan {#open-plan}"
msgstr "Open Plan {#open-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run your quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs for free (up to 10 "
"minutes per 28-day rolling window). You can track your usage on the "
"[Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) and the "
"[Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) pages.  Open Plan "
"instances can only be created in the us-east region (you can switch regions "
"from the drop-down menu at the top of the Platform dashboard). [Click to go "
"the sign-up page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration).\n"
msgstr ""
"Patakbuhin ang iyong mga quantum circuit sa pinakamahuhusay na QPU sa buong "
"mundo nang libre (hanggang 10 minuto bawat 28-araw na rolling window). "
"Maaari mong subaybayan ang iyong paggamit sa mga pahina ng [Platform "
"dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) at "
"[Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads). Ang mga Open Plan "
"instance ay maaari lamang gawin sa us-east region (maaari kang lumipat ng "
"region mula sa drop-down menu sa itaas ng Platform dashboard). [I-click para"
" pumunta sa sign-up page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This plan is recommended for those who are learning quantum computing and "
"exploring IBM quantum technology.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inirerekomenda ang planong ito para sa mga natututo pa lang ng quantum "
"computing at nagte-explore ng IBM quantum technology.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limited time promotion\">\n"
"As of 16 March 2026, active Open Plan users can opt in to an additional 180 minutes over the next 12 months.\n"
"Read the [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates) blog for full details.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limited time promotion\">\n"
"As of 16 March 2026, active Open Plan users can opt in to an additional 180 minutes over the next 12 months.\n"
"Read the [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates) blog for full details.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Flex Plan {#flex-plan}"
msgstr "Flex Plan {#flex-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Pre-purchase a certain number of minutes (at least 400) for running quantum "
"jobs, to be used within one year of purchase.  You can purchase more minutes"
" at any time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mag-pre-purchase ng tiyak na bilang ng minuto (hindi bababa sa 400) para sa "
"pagpapatakbo ng mga quantum job, na gagamitin sa loob ng isang taon mula sa "
"pagbili. Puwede kang bumili ng dagdag na minuto anumang oras.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After purchasing time, you must allocate the minutes to existing or new "
"instances on the Flex Plan for your account.  Set or update allocation "
"limits on the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) or "
"set the allocation when you [create a new Flex Plan "
"instance](/guides/instances).  If you allocate all of the minutes to "
"existing instances, you can't create a new instance for the Flex Plan until "
"you purchase more minutes or remove some minutes from another instance's "
"allocation. See [Set instance allocation limits](allocation-limits) to learn"
" more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos bumili ng oras, kailangan mong i-allocate ang mga minuto sa mga "
"kasalukuyan o bagong instance sa Flex Plan para sa iyong account. Itakda o "
"i-update ang mga allocation limit sa [Instances "
"page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) o itakda ang allocation kapag"
" [gumawa ka ng bagong Flex Plan instance](/guides/instances). Kung na-"
"allocate mo na ang lahat ng minuto sa mga kasalukuyang instance, hindi ka "
"makakagawa ng bagong instance para sa Flex Plan hanggang bumili ka ng dagdag"
" na minuto o mag-alis ng ilang minuto mula sa allocation ng ibang instance. "
"Tingnan ang [Set instance allocation limits](allocation-limits) para matuto "
"pa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you need more than 10,000 minutes, you should consider a Premium Plan "
"subscription instead. If you don't want to purchase 400 minutes, consider "
"the Pay-As-You-Go Plan instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung kailangan mo ng higit sa 10,000 minuto, dapat mong isaalang-alang ang "
"isang Premium Plan subscription. Kung ayaw mong bumili ng 400 minuto, "
"isaalang-alang ang Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-"
"quantum) to sign up for a Flex Plan.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Makipag-ugnayan sa IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-"
"en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) para mag-sign up sa Flex Plan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#pay-as-you-go-plan}"
msgstr "Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#pay-as-you-go-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs and pay only for the QPU "
"consumption you use.\n"
msgstr ""
"Patakbuhin ang mga quantum circuit sa pinakamahuhusay na QPU sa buong mundo "
"at magbayad lamang para sa QPU consumption na iyong ginagamit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This plan is recommended for those who are performing quantum utility "
"research projects and testing business models with flexible access. If you "
"will be using at least 400 minutes in the next year, it is recommended that "
"you use the Flex Plan instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inirerekomenda ang planong ito para sa mga nagsasagawa ng quantum utility "
"research projects at nagsu-subukan ng mga business model na may flexible na "
"access. Kung gagamit ka ng hindi bababa sa 400 minuto sa susunod na taon, "
"inirerekomenda na gamitin mo na lang ang Flex Plan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Premium Plan {#premium-plan}"
msgstr "Premium Plan {#premium-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs using an enterprise "
"subscription. Additionally, some functionality, such as [Qiskit "
"Functions](/guides/functions), is available to Premium Plan users.\n"
msgstr ""
"Patakbuhin ang mga quantum circuit sa pinakamahuhusay na QPU sa buong mundo "
"gamit ang enterprise subscription. Bukod pa rito, ang ilang functionality, "
"tulad ng [Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions), ay available sa mga "
"gumagamit ng Premium Plan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This plan is recommended for those who want to execute a strategic quantum "
"roadmap and develop quantum algorithms and applications at scale. [Contact "
"IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to "
"learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inirerekomenda ang planong ito para sa mga gustong magsagawa ng "
"estratehikong quantum roadmap at mag-develop ng mga quantum algorithm at "
"application sa malaking sukat. [Makipag-ugnayan sa "
"IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) para "
"matuto pa.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "On-Prem Plan {#on-prem-plan}"
msgstr "On-Prem Plan {#on-prem-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Access an entirely dedicated on-premises quantum system that is serviced and"
" maintained by IBM Quantum.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ma-access ang isang ganap na dedicated na on-premises quantum system na "
"sineserbisyuhan at pinapanatili ng IBM Quantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This service is recommended for those who are exploring classical quantum "
"algorithms and applications and need high control over their resources and "
"data. [Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-"
"en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inirerekomenda ang serbisyong ito para sa mga nagse-explore ng mga "
"classical-quantum algorithm at application at nangangailangan ng mataas na "
"kontrol sa kanilang mga resource at data. [Makipag-ugnayan sa "
"IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) para "
"matuto pa.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Compare available plans](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products).\n"
"  -  Understand what counts as [usage](/guides/estimate-job-run-time).\n"
"  -  Learn about the [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler)\n"
"  -  Access plans by creating [instances](/guides/instances).\n"
"  -  [Upgrade from the Open Plan](/guides/upgrade-from-open).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga rekomendasyon\">\n"
"  -  [Ikumpara ang mga available na plano](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products).\n"
"  -  Alamin kung ano ang binibilang bilang [paggamit](/guides/estimate-job-run-time).\n"
"  -  Matuto tungkol sa [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler)\n"
"  -  I-access ang mga plano sa pamamagitan ng paglikha ng mga [instance](/guides/instances).\n"
"  -  [Mag-upgrade mula sa Open Plan](/guides/upgrade-from-open).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
